diff --git a/docker/ralue/README.md b/docker/ralue/README.md
index 6fece7b3..95e2f946 100644
--- a/docker/ralue/README.md
+++ b/docker/ralue/README.md
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@ commit in `UPSTREAM.lock`.
 - `ralue-upstream-26.04.2.4`: immutable upstream source before Ralue changes.
 - `ralue/mvp-editor`: working branch for the branded editor.
 - `ralue/editor:upstream-26.04.2.4`: locally compiled, unmodified baseline.
-- `ralue/editor:mvp-26.04.2.12`: branded MVP with the full-color Ralue toolbar and stable Writer zoom.
+- `ralue/editor:mvp-26.04.2.13`: branded MVP with the full-color Ralue toolbar and stable Writer zoom.
 
 ## Build and resume
 
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@ Docker BuildKit caches downloads, npm dependencies, and completed build layers.
 If a stage fails, correct it and run the same command; completed stages are not
 rebuilt. A durable export of the cache is kept under `.build-progress/cache`.
 
-Browser assets use the hexadecimal Ralue revision `fdb46de0f5`, separate from the pinned
+Browser assets use the hexadecimal Ralue revision `5a1704217d`, separate from the pinned
 upstream engine hash. Bump this revision for each deployable UI release so
 browsers never reuse bundles from an older editor build.
 
@@ -91,7 +91,7 @@ After deployment, verify all three routes through the public hostname:
 ```text
 /hosting/discovery
 /hosting/capabilities
-/browser/fdb46de0f5/cool.html
+/browser/5a1704217d/cool.html
 ```
 
 Then run an authenticated open, edit, save, close, and reopen test through the
@@ -116,7 +116,7 @@ Validated locally on 2026-09-23:
 
 - discovery, capabilities, logo, favicon, and browser bundle returned HTTP 200;
 - product name is `Ralue Editor`, source version is `26.04.2.4`, and the
-  deployable browser revision is `fdb46de0f5`;
+  deployable browser revision is `5a1704217d`;
 - the engine binary `libmergedlo.so` has the same SHA-256 in the upstream and
   branded images: `cd949dab5bdc1c7158da06debd9fff493833eed581149cb7118c00fa71103c1e`;
 - a real DOCX opened through the existing WOPI host, was edited, saved into a
diff --git a/docker/ralue/build-online.sh b/docker/ralue/build-online.sh
index f6a29574..016e350d 100644
--- a/docker/ralue/build-online.sh
+++ b/docker/ralue/build-online.sh
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@ set -Eeuo pipefail
 readonly source_dir=/src
 readonly stage_dir=/stage
 readonly poco_prefix=/opt/ralue-poco
-readonly online_hash=fdb46de0f5
+readonly online_hash=5a1704217d
 readonly max_connections="${RALUE_MAX_CONNECTIONS:-1000000}"
